clashes with the exported elog.c function, include utils/varlena.h for
SplitIdentifierString(), replace the removed pg_atoi() with
pg_strtoint32(), and read the virtual transaction id from
MyProc->vxid. Also check MyProcPort before reading remote_port, as the
remote_host field already does; background processes have no port.

